	(footprint "ModularLight:EdgeContacts_SpringPads"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "563cb39f-7689-49cc-93fb-1d439e50a9a2")
		(at 100 100)
		(descr "Seam-bridge contact pads (SPEC V6 3.3): 10 pads on the exterior face B.Cu, 3.0 mm wide at 5.0 mm pitch, centred. X1..X10 = GND +36V GND CANH CANL DRIVE SENSE_EDGE SPARE +36V GND. Pads start 0.3 (GND) / 0.6 (+36V) / 0.9 mm (signals) from the wall edge and end at z 6.0 mm (V6; V5 was 8.0). The BW0019CG bridge spring touches at z 3.5 nominal (<= 5.0 incl. tolerances). B.Cu rule area (no pour, no vias, tracks allowed) up to z 5.3, so each pad may carry vias in its top end (z 5.4-6.0, decision 0007 method); full mask opening up to z 6.1.")
